ArrayList
Learn: add, get, set, remove, contains, loop.
Exercise: store student names; search, update, and remove one.

LinkedList
Learn why it differs from ArrayList; also use it as a Queue/Deque.
Exercise: browser history or a simple waiting line.

HashSet
Learn uniqueness, equals() and hashCode().
Exercise: remove duplicate words from a sentence.

LinkedHashSet and TreeSet
Learn insertion order vs sorted order.
Exercise: maintain unique usernames in entered order, then print a sorted version.

HashMap
Learn put, get, getOrDefault, containsKey, remove, entrySet.
Exercise: count frequency of each character or word.

LinkedHashMap and TreeMap
Learn predictable insertion order vs key-sorted order.
Exercise: store marks by student ID and print them in sorted-ID order.

Queue and PriorityQueue
Learn offer, peek, poll.
Exercise: customer service queue; then task processing by priority.

Deque / ArrayDeque
Learn addFirst, addLast, removeFirst, removeLast, peekFirst.
Exercise: implement a stack and a queue using ArrayDeque.

Concurrent collections
Learn these after threads: ConcurrentHashMap, BlockingQueue, CopyOnWriteArrayList.

For every topic, make one Java file with this structure: